  "comment": "Sumber: http://www.troubleshooters.com/linux/prepostpath.htm Pre and Post Pathing Linux determines the executable search path with the $PATH environment variable. To add directory /data/myscripts to the beginning of the $PATH environment variable, use the following: PATH=/data/myscripts:$PATH To add that directory to the end of the path, use the following command: PATH=$PATH:/data/myscripts But",
